參考以下文章, 詳細內容請專業人士分享:

1. 提供R初步聲音的分析簡介
http://samcarcagno.altervista.org/blog/basic-sound-processing-r/

2. tuneR 套件-讀取聲音檔案
https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/tuneR/index.html

3.signal 套件- 提供 Inverse FFT

4. seewave 套件- 提供 Cepstrum or real cepstrum

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/seewave/vignettes/seewave_IO.pdf

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/seewave/vignettes/seewave_analysis.pdf

5. fft {stats}- 提供 Fast Discrete Fourier Transform (FFT)
